Modifications: rewritten in house style rather than copied. GDScript samples
were replaced with engine-neutral pseudocode and pointers to the engine
skill. Corrected the loudness target: upstream said about -14 to -16 LUFS;
the port uses -24 LUFS (+/-2) for console and PC (Sony ASWG-R001) and about
-18 LUFS for mobile and handheld (PlayStation guidance as reported by
Audiokinetic), checked on 2026-10-17. Added voice limits and steal policy,
mute-at-zero handling, a resume-at-position transition, dwell time and
frame-rate-independent smoothing for intensity, and accessibility pointers.
